@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Player" as Player
participant ":System" as System

activate Player

    Player -> System : asks to build a station
    activate System

        System --> Player : shows station category list and asks to select one
    deactivate System

    Player -> System : selects a station category
    activate System

        System --> Player : requests data (i.e. location, centre)
    deactivate System

    Player -> System : types requested data
    activate System

        System --> Player : shows all data and requests confirmation
    deactivate System

    Player -> System : confirms data and station building
    activate System

        System --> Player : displays operation success
    deactivate System
@enduml